      "writtenOn": "2021-03-17T17:41:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason for simply removing it is that even for an @SystemApi, we\u0027d have to implement the logic to check permissions, which is nasty. My suggestion is to leave the field in as @hide and then simply scrub it for any caller that isn\u0027t system process or phone process. Even the shell needs to have this scrubbed.",
